# phase5/out stays excluded, with a narrow exception for the two val-2025 grid JSONs: the
# write-up's encoder table is rebuilt from stress_grid_val2025_fixed.json directly rather than
# from transcribed figures, and the .PREV.json is the only record of the pre-rerun numbers.
# Everything else under phase5/out/ remains ignored.
phase5/out/*
!phase5/out/stress_grid_val2025_fixed.json
!phase5/out/stress_grid_val2025_fixed.PREV.json
!phase5/out/stress_grid_val2025_fixed.OPENCAST.json

